OL,3,AAustria's Islamic headscarf ban in
OL,4,Aforce as under-14s go back to school
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut critics say the new law is fuelling
OL,7,Fanti-Muslim feeling in the country and
OL,8,Fcould be unconstitutional.
